Hi Mengyuan,

Regarding cellxgene.census, which I see is in the chanzuckerberg r-universe, Bioconductor's current policy states that dependencies should come from either Bioconductor or CRAN as noted at https://contributions.bioconductor.org/description.html?q=depend#depends-imports-suggests-enhances. Alternative approaches are being evaluated but at this time the policy hasn't changed.

